<title>UK: Barclays to return 500 mln stg of equity.</title>
<headline>Barclays to return 500 mln stg of equity.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc said it expects to return some 500 million stg of equity capital to shareholders in the next twelve months.</p>
</text>
